The root cause is now concrete: the command sandbox unshares PIDs but exposes the host `/proc`, so Lean asks for `/proc/<namespace-pid>/exe` and cannot locate itself. I’m applying a narrow runtime shim that only rewrites that executable-path lookup to `/proc/self/exe`; it does not alter Lean sources, generated files, proof terms, or checker logic. I’ll record both the failed unshimmed runs and the successful/failed shimmed result.
apply patch
