+semantics and is not a locally declared proof-extension module. There are no
+rule sentences, hence no source spans, normalized rule hashes, source_rule_ids,
+simplification attributes, or classifications to account for. The canonical
+inventory document is the empty list, whose SHA-256 is the recorded
+4f53cda... hash. Therefore the independent classification is genuinely empty:
+zero DEFINITION, zero OPERATIONAL_RULE, zero PROVED_DERIVED_LEMMA, and zero
+DOMAIN_LEMMA entries.
