+readlink to locate its running executable, so the unshared PID/host-/proc
+mismatch caused the failure. A narrow LD_PRELOAD shim was compiled from
+/tmp/audit-work/lean-app-path-shim.c. It changes only readlink requests of the
+form /proc/<digits>/exe to /proc/self/exe.
+
